# Before making the repo public, uncomment these: the licences forbid sharing the raw packs publicly
# (Raven Fantasy Icons: see its LICENSE-NOTE.md; Super Pixel Effects: see Resources/Fx/CREDITS.md).
# reverse-shell/Assets/_Project/Art/ThirdParty/RavenFantasyIcons/
