# reverse-shell/Assets/_Project/Art/ThirdParty/CardPacks/
# Card back (itch.io; credit required, no redistribution): Stars in a Box Major Arcana Tarot Cards.
# reverse-shell/Assets/_Project/Art/ThirdParty/MajorArcana/
# reverse-shell/Assets/_Project/Art/ThirdParty/MajorArcana.meta

